Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:01.24,0:42:04.24,673a120ce8dd16194061dbfe,Gray,0,0,0,,Do you want to cancel the operation? Cancel canceled.
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:03.80,0:42:04.36,673a120ce8dd16194061dbff,Gray,0,0,0,,Да.
